Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||07-02-2001||10:32 PM||||I Picked up a SONY MVC-CD300 Mavica Camera today.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/shh1.jpg">  <BR>Holy cow is this neat. It write's to a CD-RW and CD-R disks.<P>Stores 1000 VGA PIC's.<P>I've already off loaded my computers hard drive, and stored the .JPG files on a CD-RW.<P>Cleaned off a bunch of space !!<P>You can access the camera like an external drive using the supplied software & USB cable.<P>I took a quick shot of my baby sleeping ...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/shh.jpg">  <P>Anyone seen this camera yet ??<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 07-03-2001).]||||reg||6
