Z||000014||beer_stud_21||07-03-2001||06:20 PM||||coolblue,<P>Whats the max resolution of that camera?  2.11megapixel etc....?   And what kind of computer setup are you connecting it to?  One of the pictures above looks like you have a Apple pro USB keyboard.  I would be really interested to hear how the camera works for you if you are in fact on a mac.   Especially with the use of the CD-R in the camera for use as a normal CD-R drive.. Very interesting.<P>-Marlin||||reg||1
Z||000015||CoolBlue87GT||07-03-2001||09:58 PM||||Max resolution : 3.3megapixel 2048 x 1536<BR> <BR>My Computer setup : COMPAQ PRESARIO Laptop, using USB supplied cord. (one end is normal USB size, the other is small for camera hookup)<BR> <BR>Makes camera act like an external CD-R / CD-RW drive.  You can copy to/from it as drive E:<BR> <BR>So far it's pretty neat.  Reads 8X's write's 4X speed<BR> <BR>Makes MPEG HQ Movies w/voice also.<BR> <BR>Display image on TV screen w/ supplied A/V cable.<P><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 07-03-2001).]||||reg||6
